BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lemnos-androni-panigiri-of-agia-marina-androni-park-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270716
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270718
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Marina\, Androni park
LOCATION:Androni\, Lemnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 'Argonautes' club of Androni\, just outside Myrina\, opens the Lemnos panigiri season with Agia Marina on the evening of 16 July in the village park\, and repeats the formula for Agios Panteleimon on 26 July with a full Lemnian orchestra (Mavrakis family violins in 2026). Souvlaki\, local wine and island dances\; ten minutes from Myrina by car. Nea Koutali and Livadochori also keep Agia Marina with church feasts.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#androni-panigiri-of-agia-marina-androni-park
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#androni-panigiri-of-agia-marina-androni-park
END:VEVENT
