BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lemnos-thanos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-thanos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270725
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270727
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Thanos
LOCATION:Thanos\, Lemnos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Thanos\, the village behind the best beaches south of Myrina\, keeps Agia Paraskevi with vespers on 25 July and liturgy on the 26th at its parish church\, followed by the village's summer feast. Myrina's own big church feast of Agios Panteleimon runs the same weekend (26-27 July). Easy from any Myrina hotel.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#thanos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-thanos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/lemnos/#thanos-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-thanos
END:VEVENT
